&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for a Director of Marketing Operations who will own the systems, data, and reporting infrastructure behind our B2B Growth Marketing team — from HubSpot/Salesforce instrumentation to pipeline attribution to the budget that funds it all. This person will lead a team across marketing analytics, marketing operations, and web optimization, and serve as the go-to partner for Sales, RevOps, Strategic Finance, and Client Success on shared data and reporting. Reporting to the Senior Director of Growth, they&#39;ll bring structure and rigor to a fast-moving org, ensuring marketing&#39;s numbers hold up in front of executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing Technology, Data &amp;amp; Attribution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HubSpot instrumentation (and its integration with Salesforce): own lead management strategy, campaign orchestration and tracking, and stage definitions for the B2B funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline attribution: own marketing&#39;s multi-touch attribution methodology and represent it in cross-team pipeline conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance: maintain data dictionaries and definitions (MQL/MQA thresholds, pipeline vs. bookings vs. revenue) so reporting stays consistent as tools and AI use expand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Martech stack: own B2B-facing tools and integrations, including CaliberMind, GA4, HubSpot, Qualified, Webflow, and evaluate new tooling as needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and enablement: ensure the has the resources and knowledge to own the reporting and orchestration of their channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KPI ownership: define and maintain B2B marketing metrics (MQLs, MQAs, pipeline coverage, Pipe-Spend ratio) and the reporting cadence behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive reporting: build and deliver pipeline briefings and performance readouts for B2B marketing leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboards: own the B2B analytics stack across CaliberMind, Looker, Data Studio, Salesforce, and GA4, and keep it accurate as definitions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FY planning support: partner with Strategic Finance and RevOps on fiscal year target-setting, run-rate projections, and scenario modeling for B2B pipeline and budget as well as org-level OKR setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership: oversee the B2B marketing budget, including forecast, actuals, monthly reconciliation, and shifts across programs and months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor management: track spend and manage relationships with external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FY planning: lead annual and quarterly budgeting and planning for B2B Growth Marketing in partnership with Strategic Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing Website &amp;amp; CRO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing website: manage the web team that owns navigation, landing pages, and on-page SEO/AEO for the Enterprise/B2B experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing and optimization: run a structured A/B testing and CRO program for B2B landing pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessibility: maintain WCAG 2.1 AA compliance across the B2B site experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People leadership: manage and develop a team covering marketing analytics, marketing operations, and web optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and tooling: set the team&#39;s operating rhythm and own its project management tooling (Asana and Jira).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds with AI: personally build AI-powered workflows for reporting, analysis, and campaign operations that enable the team to make better decisions and scale without additional headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI enablement: lead rollout of AI tools within B2B Growth Marketing, including data governance for tools connected to live CRM and marketing data, and set the team&#39;s judgment for where AI helps and where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional partnership: serve as B2B Growth Marketing&#39;s primary point of contact for Sales, SDR, RevOps, Strategic Finance, and Client Success on shared data, process, and reporting questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
