&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for a Technical Recruiting Lead to own technical recruiting across Engineering, Product, and Design. This is a player-coach role: you&#39;ll personally run full life-cycle recruiting for our most critical and complex technical roles, while also managing a small team of recruiters and/or sourcers supporting the broader tech hiring effort. You&#39;ll report to the Director of Recruiting and partner closely with engineering, product, and design leadership to translate hiring plans into real, hired talent. The right person is energized by both — closing a hard search themselves and developing the people around them to do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for senior and specialized Engineering, Product, and Design searches, from intake through offer close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop a small team of recruiters supporting technical hiring, balancing their growth with your own individual search load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with engineering, product, and design leaders to translate hiring plans into sourcing and interview strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and maintain the standard for technical hiring at Maven — structured interview plans, calibration, and data-driven pipeline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use funnel and time-to-fill data to identify bottlenecks and drive process improvements across the tech recruiting function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI to streamline sourcing, screening, and candidate communication, in line with Maven&#39;s AI-first recruiting practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on the technical talent market to advise hiring leaders on competitive positioning, leveling, and compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Maven&#39;s technical hiring brand to candidates — ensuring every touchpoint reflects our mission and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full life-cycle technical recruiting experience, including 3+ years managing or leading recruiters/sourcers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built and personally run technical recruiting for a specialized, high-velocity team — and scaled a recruiting pod around you to do the same — without dropping the bar on either side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You genuinely want both jobs: closing your own hard Engineering, Product, or Design searches for Maven&#39;s leadership, and developing the recruiters and sourcers who work for you. One without the other wouldn&#39;t satisfy you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve managed people through at least 2-3 full performance review cycles, from goal-setting through calibration, and hold your own search pipeline to that same rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know the difference between a good hire and a great one for a mission-driven health tech company like Maven, and hold yourself to that bar in your own searches just as much as you hold your team to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You measure what matters — pipeline conversion, source quality, time-to-fill against our SLAs — across both your own reqs and your team&#39;s, and use data to coach, not just report status.&lt;/li&gt;
